                    {
                        "name":  "places/ChIJkSOTUfKrQjQRmr6m00-3INA/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21sbVgxOXFXbGxNWVdJd2VUVTBURkZuZFVjdE5FRRAB",
                        "relativePublishTimeDescription":  "3 months ago",
                        "rating":  5,
                        "text":  {
                                     "text":  "This is the only branch left of my favorite pasta restaurant! 🥹 I ordered the following dishes:\n\n🍝Yuzu Pepper Clam Pasta $278\n\n👉🏻Set B (with $208 appetizer + $100 drink) $208\n✅Sea Urchin Cream Seafood Omelette +$30\n✅Sun Moon Tea (100-year-old tea brand)\n\n🍝Salted Kelp Vegetable Pasta $278\n\n🍝Truffle Soft-boiled Egg Vegetable Soy Milk Pasta $318\n\n👉🏻Set A (with $180 dessert + $100 drink) $178\n\n✅Hokkaido Ice Cream Basque Cake +$10\n✅Ayaka Honey Lemon Sparkling Water +$60\n\nI loved the strong yuzu pepper flavor in the clam pasta! 😍 I highly recommend the Sea Urchin Cream Seafood Omelette. I was worried the egg would be overcooked and have a heavy shell, but it was soft and tender with cheese inside. Everyone said it was delicious!! Hokkaido ice cream Basque cake is a seasonal limited edition; it\u0027s quite sweet, and people with ant-like features would probably like it.\n\nOverall, it\u0027s a restaurant I\u0027d definitely want to visit again. 🍴\n\nFor more food reviews, follow me on IG: yayosharon_food",
                                     "languageCode":  "en-US"
                                 },
                        "originalText":  {
                                             "text":  "超喜歡的義大利麵店 剩這家分店了🥹\n點了以下餐點：\n🍝柚子胡椒蛤蜊麵 $278\n👉🏻B套餐（附$208開胃菜＋$100飲品）$208\n✅海膽奶油海鮮歐姆蛋 +$30\n✅百年製茶日月紅茶\n🍝鹽昆布蔬菜麵 $278\n🍝松露半熟蛋蔬菜豆乳麵 $318\n👉🏻A套餐（附$180甜點+$100飲品）$178\n✅北海道冰淇淋巴斯克蛋糕 +$10\n✅彩花蜜蜂蜜檸檬氣泡水 +$60\n\n蛤蜊麵的柚子胡椒味道很濃我很愛😍\n海膽奶油海鮮歐姆蛋超推薦 本來很擔心蛋會不會過熟蛋皮感很重 結果又軟又嫩裡面有起司 大家都說好吃‼️\n北海道冰淇淋巴斯克蛋糕是季節限定 蠻甜的 螞蟻人應該會喜歡\n總之是會想再訪的餐廳🍴\n\n想看更多美食分享歡迎到IG: yayosharon_food",
                                             "languageCode":  "zh-Hant"
                                         },
